{"layout":"logicalStructure","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>机器学习</p>","expand":true,"uid":"37991074-0916-4df5-b916-afb103d3209e","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{"smm_img_key_05be4571-5599-4c89-96f7-8f2de945d080":"data:image/png;base64,"},"freeNodeTrees":[]},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>导论</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"226eee51-c775-4734-88a3-ccadf0402181","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>具体功能</p>","uid":"7dd0f479-5024-44f9-ae10-6472c1ee3e8c","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>找函数</p>","uid":"52507b2c-a6a8-4904-8dac-a34fb3a2f9d0","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>regression</p>","uid":"ef7e6d43-8c05-487d-ac2b-dd7526194054","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>函数是结果是模拟值</p>","uid":"2009d393-77b3-4ac8-946b-1a7249dc0377","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>classification</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"0d498470-9f9f-4b48-8828-97b97fd78577"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>函数结果是离散的</p>","uid":"e0f87c24-7a2d-4cd6-82e6-ce3b6785a4ea","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>这些结果都是在确定范围内</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"afcb8949-2c82-4f59-b63d-6f2538e8412b"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>struct learning</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"d4ad8b7c-a4cc-4fe8-a78e-7ea480beb372"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>结果不是确定范围内的或者说结果内部结构不是确定的</p>","uid":"b0ba1525-7352-45da-8430-485edf68012d","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>创造性的工作</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"93207225-c81d-46fe-aae6-6ea390118dc3"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>基本流程</p>","uid":"5e1a164c-dfd0-4985-852d-1c0ab74870b4","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>确定函数模型，如<span class=\"ql-formula\" data-value=\"y=b+wx\">﻿<span contenteditable=\"false\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=b+wx</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>﻿</span></p>","uid":"017f916e-6d72-4ea9-8bd3-c72c79d47675","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>确定L(b,w)(判断b,w符合程度)，根据L(b,w)求出符合程度值</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"75b9f04b-0120-4844-a426-a5476595b1e2"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>均差判断</p>","uid":"b290d7c8-bc86-45dc-a160-fadc888f442e","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>方差判断</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"0fd9c47e-2f0b-4711-81fc-a5923e932489"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>寻找符合程度值</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"8456b007-36d5-456c-bea3-dc9b02ec58d5"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>单梯度下降法</p>","uid":"b9985d57-2612-4854-a2c9-faa6bf95f49d","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>先找一个<span class=\"ql-formula\" data-value=\"w_0\">﻿<span contenteditable=\"false\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_0</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>﻿</span></p>","uid":"876bf017-bd28-4253-919b-506707ba4dc9","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>按照公式<span class=\"ql-formula\" data-value=\"w_1=w_0-\\eta\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}|_{(w_0)} \">﻿<span contenteditable=\"false\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_1=w_0-\\eta\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}|_{(w_0)} </annotation></semantics></math></span></span>﻿</span>，求出下一个<span class=\"ql-formula\" data-value=\"w_1\">﻿<span contenteditable=\"false\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_1</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>﻿</span></p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"e9f172f0-419a-4c15-89d7-9d82c4452f25"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>直到公式<span class=\"ql-formula\" data-value=\"w_{n}\">﻿<span contenteditable=\"false\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>﻿</span>=<span class=\"ql-formula\" data-value=\"w_{n-1}\">﻿<span contenteditable=\"false\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>﻿</span>,得到区域最优解</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"a0c6dff2-68fd-4bbd-aed5-a954b5aafcf8"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>缺点</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"122974ec-85ff-40a0-a977-beec34e1a75d"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>只会找到区域最优解，找不到最优解</p>","uid":"887f5cff-1d6f-4bba-8c45-b1e34d91464d","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>多梯度下降法</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"801e620c-08b6-4a37-953b-7189b847fe7a"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p><br></p>","uid":"ad83bc64-bf98-4c6a-acb6-3536b10ebd54","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_05be4571-5599-4c89-96f7-8f2de945d080","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":651,"height":463,"custom":false}},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>返回第一步，进一步优化函数模型</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"dda8dc64-9830-4d04-830a-a786397290cc"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"theme":{"template":"classic4","config":{}},"view":{"transform":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"shear":0,"rotate":0,"translateX":-663,"translateY":-446,"originX":0,"originY":0,"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"e":-663,"f":-446},"state":{"scale":1,"x":-663,"y":-446,"sx":0,"sy":-400}}}